flowchart LR
  UTC[FarmPi UTC] --> NZ[Pacific/Auckland local date]
  NZ --> SUN[latitude + monthly baseline + sunrise/sunset]
  SUN --> WEATHER[coherent weather: cloud/rain/pressure/wind]
  WEATHER --> P[16 stable paddock states]
  P --> R[one 5-minute round]
  R --> T[staggered telemetry every 18.75 seconds]
